Both 8 and 32 bit versions work, but the acceration leaves a little
to be desired.  As well as the older TGAs, the kernel and base X
server also support the TGA2's (PowerStorm 3d30 and PowerStorm 4d20)
which are old, but not quite as old as the ZLXp-E{1,2,3}.

